WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.137
- I mean I'm not at all jealous

00:00:02.137 --> 00:00:03.596
of your beautiful pregnant self.

00:00:03.596 --> 00:00:05.099
No seriously.

00:00:05.099 --> 00:00:06.790
- I'm trying to squeeze into this dress.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:07.659
- You're pregnant.

00:00:07.659 --> 00:00:08.902
- As I sit, thank you.
- Oh I get it

00:00:08.902 --> 00:00:10.036
and I'm not pregnant.

00:00:10.036 --> 00:00:11.322
But the same thing happened to me.

00:00:11.322 --> 00:00:12.819
- Yeah, if it's not Spanx for pregnant

00:00:12.819 --> 00:00:15.165
it's Spanx for regular
day life all the time.

00:00:15.165 --> 00:00:17.962
- Oh my God, if I were pregnant
I would not wear Spanx,

00:00:17.962 --> 00:00:19.282
you just own it.

00:00:19.282 --> 00:00:20.493
- Yeah, but there's something

00:00:20.493 --> 00:00:21.769
it's kind of comforting or something.

00:00:21.769 --> 00:00:22.648
- I feel you though,

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:23.530
it kind of holds you,

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:24.474
you feel like your stomach's escaping.

00:00:24.474 --> 00:00:25.371
It's like a separate thing.

00:00:25.371 --> 00:00:26.685
- Especially this time around.

00:00:26.685 --> 00:00:27.563
- I'm so glad you're pregnant

00:00:27.563 --> 00:00:28.434
and not me.

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:29.480
- Yes!
- I can't emphasize

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:30.360
that enough.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.491
- [Jenna] That's so funny.
- But you are very

00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:32.476
pregnant so are you excited?

00:00:32.476 --> 00:00:33.744
- Yes!
- It's your second right?

00:00:33.744 --> 00:00:34.748
- Second.

00:00:34.748 --> 00:00:35.682
I'm so excited.

00:00:35.682 --> 00:00:37.182
It's been amazing.

00:00:38.426 --> 00:00:41.132
First pregnancy was really easy.

00:00:41.132 --> 00:00:43.292
Evie was like a dream pregnancy

00:00:43.292 --> 00:00:44.776
and this time around

00:00:44.776 --> 00:00:47.848
also really great but
everything's happening faster.

00:00:47.848 --> 00:00:49.531
I'm swelling faster.

00:00:49.531 --> 00:00:51.215
I have heartburn faster.

00:00:51.215 --> 00:00:52.949
I was way more nauseous this time around.

00:00:52.949 --> 00:00:55.936
So it's just like, yeah,
it's a little different.

00:00:55.936 --> 00:00:57.270
- Maybe that means that the
opposite sex is happening.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.171
- I know, I know.
- Yeah, maybe.

00:00:58.171 --> 00:00:59.291
So is this

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:03.360
did you ever have any of the weird stuff

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.117
like either weird cravings or weird dreams

00:01:05.117 --> 00:01:06.502
or anything like that?
- Yes.

00:01:06.502 --> 00:01:07.373
- [Kelly] Okay.
- So many weird things.

00:01:07.373 --> 00:01:09.023
- I only had dreams of not being pregnant.

00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:12.005
- You were like please,
God, when is this done?

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:12.894
- Get out!

00:01:12.894 --> 00:01:13.771
- When is this done?

00:01:13.771 --> 00:01:16.499
Yeah, no, with Evie, I was super healthy.

00:01:16.499 --> 00:01:19.195
I was actually finally,
I wanted grapefruit.

00:01:19.195 --> 00:01:20.292
Which was like,
- [Kelly] Oh, God.

00:01:20.292 --> 00:01:21.440
- Thank you, Evie.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:22.627
- I secretly can't stand you, it's fine.

00:01:22.627 --> 00:01:25.029
- Yeah, no, not this time, though.

00:01:25.029 --> 00:01:27.757
This time I'm like, I want junk food.

00:01:27.757 --> 00:01:29.098
I want everything bad.

00:01:29.098 --> 00:01:29.931
It's really.

00:01:29.931 --> 00:01:31.473
But it was immediate.

00:01:31.473 --> 00:01:32.734
I was like where's the chips.

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:34.316
Where's Taco Bell?

00:01:34.316 --> 00:01:36.027
I was like I needed like junk food.

00:01:36.027 --> 00:01:38.138
- Okay, I can roll with
this kid, all right.

00:01:38.138 --> 00:01:39.172
- [Jenna] And the dreams.

00:01:39.172 --> 00:01:40.419
Did you have the crazy pregnant dreams?

00:01:40.419 --> 00:01:43.013
- I literally only dreamed
of not being pregnant.

00:01:43.013 --> 00:01:43.990
I had,

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:45.409
that was not an actual joke.

00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:46.280
- Oh yeah.

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:48.556
No I dream really weird this pregnancy.

00:01:48.556 --> 00:01:51.051
I had a dream the other night
that I was playing hockey

00:01:51.051 --> 00:01:53.061
with a bunch of hockey players

00:01:53.061 --> 00:01:54.845
and then all of a sudden
we turned into balloons

00:01:54.845 --> 00:01:56.791
and we started floating and the problem

00:01:56.791 --> 00:01:58.368
was we couldn't keep
our skates on the ice.

00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:01.338
I woke up I was like, what was that?

00:02:01.338 --> 00:02:02.218
- What does that mean?

00:02:02.218 --> 00:02:04.467
- I need to feel grounded?

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:05.714
I had no idea.

00:02:05.714 --> 00:02:06.726
- Were you pregnant while you,

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:07.605
- Yes.
- In the dream?

00:02:07.605 --> 00:02:08.474
- Yes!

00:02:08.474 --> 00:02:09.355
- Just ice skating pregnant.
- Yes!

00:02:09.355 --> 00:02:10.282
- Playing hockey.
- That's another thing.

00:02:10.282 --> 00:02:11.516
Yes I'm pregnant in the dream.
- That's what you do.

00:02:11.516 --> 00:02:12.729
Which is really weird.

00:02:12.729 --> 00:02:14.450
- Oh my God I missed
out on the fun dreams.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.135
- I would've woke up trying to like

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:18.268
get some dream book, figure that out.

00:02:18.268 --> 00:02:19.801
Like what's wrong with me?

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:21.102
- I know I just looked over,

00:02:21.102 --> 00:02:22.699
I was like that was so weird.

00:02:22.699 --> 00:02:25.121
I was like why am I dreaming
of hockey ever, ever?

00:02:25.121 --> 00:02:27.140
- I'm super excited for you.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.091
- Thank you.

00:02:28.091 --> 00:02:29.661
- It's a very cool thing to be a mom now.

00:02:29.661 --> 00:02:31.001
It's my favorite thing I do.

